# Where the contact and newsletter forms POST.
#
# Leave this unset and both forms fall back to opening the visitor's email
# client — functional, but clunky. Set it to a form service endpoint to get
# proper inline submission:
#
#   Formspree   https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Web3Forms   https://api.web3forms.com/submit   (then add your access key
#               as a hidden field named "access_key")
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for local dev, and add the same variable in the
# Cloudflare Pages dashboard under Settings > Environment variables.
# The PUBLIC_ prefix is required — it tells Astro to expose it to the browser.
PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
